notes.content:
Hey, everyone!

Just stopping by to let you know that we’re still working hard on the game. (Now I totally understand why Silksong is taking so long to release!) The project is getting more and more complex and ambitious, but we’re steadily implementing everything we’ve planned, such as:

Weapon systems;
Upgrades;
Item, equipment, and weapon crafting;
Interactive map;
Side quests;
And so much more!
We’ve also given the entire UI a complete overhaul to make it clearer and more user-friendly. Plus, we’ve updated our custom pixel art font to make it even easier to read!

And on top of all that, we have a gorgeous new cover art! 😍

We’re aiming to release the demo in 2025, but we’re not ready to promise a specific date just yet. 
[strike]It’s like George R. R. Martin says, "It’ll be ready when it’s ready" hahaha!🤣 [/strike]
Thank you all for your support! 💖
